SUMMARY:From Raw Data to Actionable Insights: Building Automated Analytics
  Workflows
DESCRIPTION:Cloud Data Driven\n**Presentation Title:** From Raw Data to Ac
 tionable Insights: Building Automated Analytics Workflows with SQL\, Power
  BI\n\n**Abstract:**\nModern organizations collect vast amounts of data\, 
 but turning that data into reliable\, actionable insights remains a challe
 nge. In this session\, you'll learn how to build an automated analytics wo
 rkflow that transforms raw operational data into business-ready dashboards
  using SQL Server\, Power BI\, and Microsoft Fabric.\n\nDrawing from real-
 world enterprise analytics experience\, we'll explore practical techniques
  for designing scalable ETL processes\, optimizing data models\, automatin
 g reporting pipelines\, and creating interactive dashboards that support f
 aster\, data-driven decision making.\n\nAttendees will also learn strategi
 es for improving report performance\, maintaining data quality\, and reduc
 ing manual reporting effort through automation. Whether you're building he
 althcare analytics\, operational reporting\, or enterprise BI solutions\, 
 these principles can be applied across industries.\n\n**Learning Objective
 :**\nDesign scalable analytics workflows from raw data to reporting.\nBuil
 d automated ETL and reporting pipelines using SQL Server and Microsoft Fab
 ric.\nOptimize Power BI models for performance and maintainability.\nApply
  practical techniques to improve data quality and reporting reliability.\n
 Identify best practices for creating enterprise-ready analytics solutions.
